{% capture velani_sent %}<div class="sent" id="inquiry-sent" tabindex="-1"><svg class="sent-i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M173.66,98.34a8,8,0,0,1,0,11.32l-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35A8,8,0,0,1,173.66,98.34ZM232,128A104,104,0,1,1,128,24,104.11,104.11,0,0,1,232,128Zm-16,0a88,88,0,1,0-88,88A88.1,88.1,0,0,0,216,128Z"/></svg><p class="note" data-sent-preview hidden>Website preview&nbsp;· this is what visitors see after sending. Nothing was sent.</p><h1 class="t2 sent-h" data-sent-h>Message sent.</h1><p class="sent-p" data-sent-p>Thanks for writing. We aim to reply by email within two business days.</p><p class="sent-from">Replies come from <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>. If it isn’t in your inbox, check spam or junk.</p><a class="pill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}{{ routes.root_url }}{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}{% endif %}">Back to home</a></div>{% endcapture %}<section class="phero cform-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker"><span class="v-d">Contact</span><span class="v-n">NEVORA for your team</span><span class="v-m">Free 30-day NEVORA trial</span><span class="v-r">NEVORA Relay</span></p><h1 class="t1 rise"><span class="v-d">Start with the problem.</span><span class="v-n">Ask for a NEVORA quote.</span><span class="v-m">Request your free NEVORA trial.</span><span class="v-r">Join the NEVORA Relay waitlist.</span></h1><p class="hfact fade"><span class="v-d">Websites, custom apps, NEVORA or something else.</span><span class="v-n">One price per business, quoted for your number of employees, your business and the features you use. No commitment.</span><span class="v-m">Up to 30 employees&nbsp;· 30 days&nbsp;· No card&nbsp;· No&nbsp;automatic&nbsp;charge</span><span class="v-r">In design&nbsp;· No dates yet. We’ll email you when early access opens.</span></p></div></section><section class="contact"><div class="wrap cform">{% if settings.inquiries_enabled and theme.role == 'main' %}{% form 'contact', id: 'project-inquiry', class: 'inquiry-form', novalidate: 'novalidate' %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}{{ velani_sent }}{% else %}<div data-inquiry-mode="live"><fieldset><legend class="sr">Inquiry</legend><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-name" name="contact[name]" placeholder=" " autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required aria-describedby="error-name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}"><label for="inquiry-name">Name</label><p class="field-error" id="error-name"></p></div><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-email" name="contact[email]" placeholder=" " type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required aria-describedby="error-email" value="{{ form.email | escape }}"><label for="inquiry-email">Email</label><p class="field-error" id="error-email"></p></div><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-company" name="contact[company]" placeholder=" " autocomplete="organization" maxlength="160" aria-describedby="error-company"><label for="inquiry-company">Company <span class="opt">optional</span></label><p class="field-error" id="error-company"></p></div><div class="ff sel field-topic"><select id="inquiry-interest" name="contact[interest]"><option value=""></option><option value="website">Website</option><option value="custom-software">Custom app</option><option value="nevora">NEVORA quote</option><option value="nevora-demo">Free NEVORA trial</option><option value="relay">NEVORA Relay waitlist</option><option value="other">Something else</option></select><label for="inquiry-interest">Topic</label></div><div class="frow" data-nevora-fields hidden><div class="ff sel"><select id="inquiry-team" name="contact[team_size]"><option value=""></option><option>1–10</option><option>11–20</option><option>21–30</option><option>More than 30 (by quote)</option></select><label for="inquiry-team">Team size</label></div><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-locations" name="contact[locations]" placeholder=" " maxlength="120" aria-describedby="error-locations" inputmode="numeric"><label for="inquiry-locations">Number of locations</label><p class="field-error" id="error-locations"></p></div></div><div class="ff area"><textarea id="inquiry-message" name="contact[body]" placeholder=" " rows="4" maxlength="4000" required aria-describedby="error-message" data-min="140">{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><label for="inquiry-message"><span class="v-d">What needs to work better</span><span class="v-n v-nm">Anything else <span class="opt">optional</span></span></label><p class="field-error" id="error-message"></p></div><button class="pill" type="submit" data-inquiry-submit><span class="v-d">Send inquiry</span><span class="v-n">Ask for a quote</span><span class="v-m">Send trial request</span></button><p class="send-note">We aim to reply by email within two business days. <a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-privacy{% endif %}">Privacy notice</a></p><p class="fine v-m">On day 30 you continue by quote or close the workplace. Export your data first: a closed workplace and its data are deleted within 3&nbsp;days, timecards and pay statements included. To close it, email support@thevelani.com. NEVORA calculates pay statements; it does not pay employees or file payroll taxes.</p></fieldset></div>{% if form.errors %}<div class="form-status" role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="form-legal">{{ 'shopify.online_store.spam_detection.disclaimer_html' | t }}</div>{% endif %}{% endform %}{% elsif theme.role == 'main' %}<div class="panel"><h2 class="t3">Write to us</h2><p>What needs to work better, who will use it, and how it works today. We reply from support@thevelani.com.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill" href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">Email support@thevelani.com</a></div><p class="field-help mail">No passwords, payment details or sensitive records by email.</p></div>{% else %}<form id="project-inquiry" class="inquiry-form" method="post" action="/?velani_preview_inquiry=1" data-inquiry-mode="preview" novalidate><p class="note">Website preview&nbsp;· checks your draft, sends nothing</p><fieldset disabled><legend class="sr">Inquiry</legend><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-name" name="contact[name]" placeholder=" " autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required aria-describedby="error-name"><label for="inquiry-name">Name</label><p class="field-error" id="error-name"></p></div><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-email" name="contact[email]" placeholder=" " type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required aria-describedby="error-email"><label for="inquiry-email">Email</label><p class="field-error" id="error-email"></p></div><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-company" name="contact[company]" placeholder=" " autocomplete="organization" maxlength="160" aria-describedby="error-company"><label for="inquiry-company">Company <span class="opt">optional</span></label><p class="field-error" id="error-company"></p></div><div class="ff sel field-topic"><select id="inquiry-interest" name="contact[interest]"><option value=""></option><option value="website">Website</option><option value="custom-software">Custom app</option><option value="nevora">NEVORA quote</option><option value="nevora-demo">Free NEVORA trial</option><option value="relay">NEVORA Relay waitlist</option><option value="other">Something else</option></select><label for="inquiry-interest">Topic</label></div><div class="frow" data-nevora-fields hidden><div class="ff sel"><select id="inquiry-team" name="contact[team_size]"><option value=""></option><option>1–10</option><option>11–20</option><option>21–30</option><option>More than 30 (by quote)</option></select><label for="inquiry-team">Team size</label></div><div class="ff"><input id="inquiry-locations" name="contact[locations]" placeholder=" " maxlength="120" aria-describedby="error-locations" inputmode="numeric"><label for="inquiry-locations">Number of locations</label><p class="field-error" id="error-locations"></p></div></div><div class="ff area"><textarea id="inquiry-message" name="contact[body]" placeholder=" " rows="4" maxlength="4000" required aria-describedby="error-message" data-min="140"></textarea><label for="inquiry-message"><span class="v-d">What needs to work better</span><span class="v-n v-nm">Anything else <span class="opt">optional</span></span></label><p class="field-error" id="error-message"></p></div><button class="pill" type="submit" data-inquiry-submit>Check draft inquiry</button><p class="send-note">We aim to reply by email within two business days. <a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-privacy{% endif %}">Privacy notice</a></p><p class="fine v-m">On day 30 you continue by quote or close the workplace. Export your data first: a closed workplace and its data are deleted within 3&nbsp;days, timecards and pay statements included. To close it, email support@thevelani.com. NEVORA calculates pay statements; it does not pay employees or file payroll taxes.</p></fieldset><div class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></div><noscript><p>The preview form needs JavaScript. No messages are sent from this preview.</p></noscript></form>{{ velani_sent | replace: 'id="inquiry-sent" tabindex="-1"', 'id="inquiry-sent" tabindex="-1" hidden' }}{% endif %}<p class="contact-aside"><a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a><br><a href="tel:+17879252000">787-925-2000</a>&nbsp;· Monday to Friday, 8 am to 9 pm ET<br>VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San&nbsp;Juan, PR&nbsp;00927</p></div></section>
